  "prefLabel": "Inst 103.04 Vacancy",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Inst 103.04 Vacancy. In the event of a vacancy a member will be appointed as provided in RSA 205-D:2, I to fill the unexpired term. If the member is held over beyond the expiration date of the commission, a vacancy shall be deemed to have been created and the member whose term has expired shall continue to serve until replaced.\n\nSource. #8492, eff 12-24-05; ss by #10336, eff 5-15-13",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/inst100-700.html"
